---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout title="Public projects — inspectable source and evidence" description="A small directory of Ruslan AI Lab's verifiable public engineering repositories. Clear separation between available source, automated checks and actual publication.">
  <div class="shell page-pad">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href={base}>Lab home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Projects</nav>
    <header class="inner-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-led" aria-hidden="true"></span> PUBLIC SOURCE / EVIDENCE FIRST</p>
      <h1>Projects with an evidence trail<span class="heading-accent">.</span></h1>
      <p>These are public code repositories with links you can inspect. A source repository, a passing automated test and a deployed site are <strong>three different kinds of evidence</strong>.</p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="projects-list-title">
      <div class="project-directory-heading">
        <h2 id="projects-list-title">Two public repositories.</h2>
        <p>Only public, independently inspectable material belongs here. Claims about deployment are limited to recorded GitHub releases.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="project-directory-grid">
        <article class="project-directory-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">PROJECT 01 / INTERACTIVE ENGINEERING</p>
          <h3>Ruslan AI Lab</h3>
          <p>Five original browser-native experiments and an AI-assisted engineering workflow documented with source, browser checks, regression history and an owner-gated publishing process.</p>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Source</dt><dd>Public Astro + TypeScript repository</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Tests</dt><dd>Exact-source CI, including browser and accessibility automation</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Publication</dt><dd>Verified P4 GitHub Pages Build + Deploy, 31 October 2026</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <div class="project-directory-links">
            <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ruslanudintsev-ai/ruslan-ai-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Inspect source ↗</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ruslanudintsev-ai/ruslan-ai-lab/actions/runs/41192989794" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">P4 release evidence ↗</a>
            <a class="text-link" href={base + "case-studies/release-gates/"}>Release case study ↗</a>
          </div>
          <p class="fine-print">Release evidence refers to P4 source SHA <code>1c13d0d3f965efc2582d38aea63aaedef8834a56</code>. Later source merges are not automatically new Pages releases.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="project-directory-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">PROJECT 02 / STATIC-WEB REBUILD</p>
          <h3>Opalubka / LAB</h3>
          <p>An educational website demo, not an operating equipment-rental company. The public repository documents replacing a misleading legacy concept with an Astro-based static demo, bounded scope and reviewable technical checks.</p>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Source</dt><dd>Public demo repository with a documented <code>modern/</code> Astro implementation</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Tests</dt><dd>Architecture and QA records published in the repository</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Publication</dt><dd>No independently verified public site release documented in its README</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <div class="project-directory-links">
            <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ruslanudintsev-ai/opalubka" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Inspect source ↗</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ruslanudintsev-ai/opalubka/pull/5" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro implementation PR ↗</a>
            <a class="text-link" href={base + "case-studies/opalubka/"}>Migration case study ↗</a>
          </div>
          <p class="fine-print">The demonstration contains no real prices, orders, customers or payment flow. A compiled source artifact is not proof of a public deployment.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-directory-notes" aria-labelledby="project-evidence-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">INTERPRETING THE RECORD</p><h2 id="project-evidence-title">Evidence before claims.</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p><strong>Source</strong> lets you inspect what was written. <strong>CI</strong> records a test run on a specified revision. <strong>Publication</strong> requires independent deployment evidence. None of these alone establishes real-world business impact.</p>
        <p>Projects without an approved public evidence package are deliberately omitted. This directory never accesses visitor data, collects contact details or runs external services.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={base + "case-studies/webkit-frame/"}>Read a real browser QA investigation ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .project-directory-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 370px); align-items: end; gap: 28px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .project-directory-heading h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.6vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0; }
  .project-directory-heading p { color: #52666b; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
  .project-directory-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .project-directory-card { min-width: 0; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #cfdbd5; border-radius: 14px; padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 34px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .project-directory-card h3 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; margin: 0 0 15px; line-height: 1.18; }
  .project-directory-card > p:not(.eyebrow):not(.fine-print) { color: #465c61; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .project-directory-card dl { margin: 0 0 22px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .project-directory-card dl div { border-top: 1px solid #dae4de; padding-top: 12px; }
  .project-directory-card dt { color: #2f6359; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .project-directory-card dd { margin: 0; color: #42575d; line-height: 1.6; font-size: .86rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .project-directory-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px 20px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 8px; }
  .project-directory-links .text-link { display: inline-block; }
  .project-directory-card .fine-print { border-top: 1px solid #dae4de; margin-top: 23px; padding-top: 15px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .project-directory-notes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 36px; padding-top: 76px; }
  .project-directory-notes h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.7vw, 3.5rem); letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: 1.12; margin: 0; }
  .project-directory-notes p:not(.eyebrow) { line-height: 1.78; color: #52666b; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .project-directory-notes a { display: inline-block; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .project-directory-heading, .project-directory-grid, .project-directory-notes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 380px) { .project-directory-links { gap: 8px 14px; } .project-directory-card { padding: 18px; } }
</style>
